{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23512","headline":"病中辱张常侍题集贤院诗因以继和 · 白居易","name":"病中辱张常侍题集贤院诗因以继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天禄阁门开，甘泉侍从回。\n图书皆帝籍，寮友尽仙才。\n骑省通中掖，龙楼隔上台。\n犹怜病宫相，诗寄洛阳来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}